          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-light" href="#consult">Plan a consultation <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
            <a class="button button-ghost" href="#treatments">Explore the menu</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-proof" aria-label="Care principles">
            <span>Personal by design</span>
            <span>Clear guidance</span>
            <span>Your pace, always</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Abstract editorial study inspired by skin, light, and movement">
          <span class="visual-number">01 / 05</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 760 920" role="img" aria-labelledby="art-title art-desc" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
            <title id="art-title">Abstract profile in mineral and copper tones</title>
            <desc id="art-desc">An original vector composition suggesting a human profile, light, and soft layered forms.</desc>
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="bg" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="#dbe7e1" />
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#9ab6aa" />
              </linearGradient>
              <linearGradient id="skin" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="#f4d8c8" />
                <stop offset="0.58" stop-color="#c98268" />
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#8d493a" />
