        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="treatment-strip" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>Consultation</span><i></i><span>Skin renewal</span><i></i><span>Injectables</span><i></i><span>Laser + light</span><i></i><span>Wellness</span>
      </div>

      <section class="section treatments" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="section-index">01 / The approach</p>
            <h2 id="approach-title">Clinical clarity. <em>Human warmth.</em></h2>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="lead">You should never feel rushed into a treatment or a version of yourself that is not yours.</p>
            <p class="detail">
              The concept centers education, measured recommendations, and room to decide. Every visual and interaction is designed to make a consultation feel calm, transparent, and personal.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="treatment-grid" id="treatments" aria-label="Illustrative treatment categories">
          <article class="treatment-card">
            <small>01</small>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="30" cy="40" r="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><circle cx="50" cy="40" r="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/></svg>
            <h3>Consultation + plan</h3>
            <p>A considered starting point for goals, questions, and treatment suitability.</p>
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span>
          </article>
          <article class="treatment-card">
            <small>02</small>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 55C24 21 56 21 66 55M22 61C32 36 48 36 58 61" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><circle cx="40" cy="26" r="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/></svg>
            <h3>Skin renewal</h3>
            <p>Illustrative options focused on texture, tone, hydration, and a healthy-looking finish.</p>
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span>
          </article>
          <article class="treatment-card">
            <small>03</small>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 40H64M40 16V64M23 23L57 57M57 23L23 57" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><circle cx="40" cy="40" r="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/></svg>
            <h3>Injectable care</h3>
            <p>A consultation-led category presented without promises, pressure, or one-size-fits-all language.</p>
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span>
          </article>
          <article class="treatment-card">
            <small>04</small>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 40C25 22 55 22 70 40C55 58 25 58 10 40Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><circle cx="40" cy="40" r="10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/></svg>
            <h3>Laser + light</h3>
            <p>A flexible content path for technology-based services, candidacy, and aftercare guidance.</p>
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span>
