      <section class="philosophy" aria-labelledby="philosophy-title">
        <div class="philosophy-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="section-index">02 / The philosophy</p>
            <h2 id="philosophy-title">Your skin, <em>not a trend.</em></h2>
          </div>
          <div class="philosophy-copy">
            <p>Good aesthetic care begins with listening. Not a template, a sales script, or somebody else's idea of what looks right.</p>
            <p>This fictional brand direction makes restraint visible: less noise, more explanation, and a path that gives every decision room to breathe.</p>
            <div class="philosophy-points">
              <span>Listen first <b aria-hidden="true">01</b></span>
              <span>Explain clearly <b aria-hidden="true">02</b></span>
              <span>Refine thoughtfully <b aria-hidden="true">03</b></span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section process" id="experience" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
        <div class="process-top">
          <div>
            <p class="section-index">03 / The experience</p>
            <h2 id="experience-title">Calm from first question to follow-up.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>A simple three-part journey gives prospective patients a clear next step without overselling an outcome.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-grid">
          <article class="process-card">
            <small>01 / Listen</small>
            <h3>Start with your goals.</h3>
            <p>A consultation creates space for questions, priorities, health history, and what you want to leave unchanged.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="process-card">
            <small>02 / Plan</small>
            <h3>Understand the options.</h3>
            <p>A real provider would review suitability, alternatives, risks, expected recovery, and costs before treatment.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="process-card">
            <small>03 / Refine</small>
            <h3>Move at your pace.</h3>
            <p>The visual system supports thoughtful follow-up and gradual care rather than urgency or pressure.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
