          <p class="section-index">05 / Good questions</p>
          <h2 id="faq-title">Clarity builds <em>confidence.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details>
            <summary><small>01</small><span>How would a consultation work?</span></summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">For a real practice, this section would explain the provider review, health history, goals, options, risks, pricing, and time to decide before any treatment.</div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><small>02</small><span>Which treatment is right for me?</span></summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">That decision belongs with a qualified medical provider after an individual evaluation. This fictional concept intentionally avoids diagnosing or recommending treatment online.</div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><small>03</small><span>What about downtime and results?</span></summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Both vary by person and procedure. A real site should provide balanced, treatment-specific education without guarantees and direct medical questions to the treating provider.</div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><small>04</small><span>Is this a real medspa?</span></summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">No. Velaire is an independent fictional design concept created by PixelFox.design. It is not a clinic, client, medical provider, or source of medical advice.</div>
          </details>
